  "notes": "Every region here can be downloaded for offline map viewing: the tiles are cached from the configured vector tile server by MapLibre into its offline store, and terrain from the Terrarium DEM. Sizes are estimates computed on device from the bounding box and zoom range. Routing is separate: a routing graph must be built with tools/build_routing_graph and shipped as a package, because Android cannot build one from a raw OSM extract. The bundled Andorra sample already includes a routing graph.",
